# Google Sheets integration (optional)
# Create a Google Cloud OAuth 2.0 client at https://console.cloud.google.com
# App type: Web application
# Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173 (dev) + your production URL
# Scopes needed: https://www.googleapis.com/auth/spreadsheets
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your client ID.

VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
